# What an ingress deploy uploads (Vercel project windkeel, root directory apps/ingress).
#
# Here because the repository root's .vercelignore is the console's allow-list, and without a file of
# its own this project inherits it. That list excludes the root tsconfig.json, src/ and migrations/,
# which `cd ../.. && npm run build` needs, so the build failed before compiling anything. A project's
# own .vercelignore takes precedence over the root one.
#
# A deny-list, because the ingress build really does need most of the repository. It still keeps
# secrets, worktrees and build output from leaving the machine.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/.vercel
.claude
